<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Jan 16.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Jan 16.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisia's milk production grew seven percent a year and will reach 790,000 tonnes in the year 2000.</p>
<p>LE RENOUVEAU</p>
<p>- Tunisia's ruling party organises forum on exports. Calls to boost export capacity.</p>
